/-
    Path: {% capture imageUrl %}{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Custom/Common/CdnUrl.lava', cdnUrl:imageUrl, cdnParams:'' %}{% endcapture %}
          {% assign imageUrl = imageUrl | Trim %}

    Description: Takes an image url and gives it back routed through Triumph Shield (Bunny CDN and its
                 Optimizer). The single implementation of that routing for the theme.

                 Only urls on this site are routed. Anything absolute is handed back untouched, which is
                 what keeps a media element's DefaultThumbnailUrl working: Rock caches that straight from
                 Vimeo, Wistia and the like, and Bunny can only optimize what it can pull from our origin.

                    /GetImage.ashx...  - Gets cdnParams, optimizer=image, and disableoptimizations=true so
                                         Rock stops reading width and height and Bunny does the resizing.
                    /Content/x.jpg     - Gets optimizer=image, which Bunny needs to cache it as an image.
                    /Themes/x.svg      - Moved onto the CDN host only. The Optimizer is for raster images.

                 Safe to run twice: a url already carrying optimizer= comes back as it went in.

                 The host is the CdnAppRoot global attribute (https://cdn.lcbcchurch.com). When it is blank
                 the path stays relative and loads from whatever host the page is on, which is only
                 behind Shield on www, not on rock.lcbcchurch.com. $cdn-theme-root in the Sass
                 variables restates the same host for theme.css.

                 Emits the url and nothing else, because a Lava include cannot hand a value back. Hence
                 capture, and the Trim is not optional.

    Parameters:
        cdnUrl    - The image url. (Required, Text. Blank comes back blank)
        cdnParams - Bunny Optimizer parameters, without a leading ? or &. Only applied to /GetImage.ashx
                    urls. (Required, Text. Pass '' for none. e.g. width=1200&aspect_ratio=1200:630)

                    Pass both on every call. Lava includes share scope going in, so one left off keeps
                    whatever the previous call set it to.
-/

//- MARK: Settings
{% assign cdnAppRoot = 'Global' | Attribute:'CdnAppRoot','RawValue' | Trim %}
{% assign cdnAppRootLast = cdnAppRoot | Right:1 %}
{% if cdnAppRootLast == '/' %}
    {% assign cdnAppRoot = cdnAppRoot | ReplaceLast:'/','' %}
{% endif %}

//- MARK: Route
{% assign cdnResult = cdnUrl | Trim %}
{% assign cdnFirst = cdnResult | Slice:0,1 %}
{% assign cdnFirstTwo = cdnResult | Slice:0,2 %}
{% assign cdnPath = cdnResult | Split:'?' | First | Downcase %}

{% if cdnFirst == '/' and cdnFirstTwo != '//' %}
    {% unless cdnResult contains 'optimizer=' %}
        {% assign cdnJoiner = '?' %}
        {% if cdnResult contains '?' %}
            {% assign cdnJoiner = '&' %}
        {% endif %}

        {% if cdnPath contains 'getimage.ashx' %}
            {% capture cdnResult %}{{ cdnResult }}{{ cdnJoiner }}{% if cdnParams != blank %}{{ cdnParams }}&{% endif %}optimizer=image&disableoptimizations=true{% endcapture %}
        {% else %}
            {% assign cdnExtension = cdnPath | Split:'.' | Last %}
            {% if cdnExtension != 'svg' %}
                {% capture cdnResult %}{{ cdnResult }}{{ cdnJoiner }}optimizer=image{% endcapture %}
            {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
    {% endunless %}

    {% assign cdnResult = cdnResult | Prepend:cdnAppRoot %}
{% endif %}

//- MARK: Markup
{{ cdnResult }}
